        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Well maintained three bedroom terrace house situated in an established development in prime location on the outskirts of Milford Town. An ideal starter home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway\n1.80m x 1.20m\n\nSitting Room\n4.80m x 3.10m Fireplace with tiled hearth and surround, T.V. Point, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 1\n2.90m x 2.80m\n\nEn-suite\n2.70m x 1.70m W.C., W.H.B., electric shower, tiled wall and floors\n\nKitchen\n4.50m x 3.90m Fitted kitchen with eye and low level units, electric oven, gas hob, fridge freezer, tiled above worksurfaces, tiled floor\n\nBedroom 2\n4.80m x 2.80m\n\nBedroom 3\n3.20m x 3.00m\n\nBathroom\n2.60m x 1.80m Bath, W.C., W.H.B.\n\n\nOutside\nCoal shed Concrete back yard Gravel area to front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
